<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank sets tender for 14-day repos at 3.00 pc.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank sets tender for 14-day repos at 3.00 pc.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Tuesday it was setting a tender for 14-day securities repurchase funds, offering banks liquidity at a fixed rate of 3.00 percent.</p>
<p>Funds will be credited to accounts tomorrow and the securities have to be repurchased on May 21.  </p>
<p>A 82.4 billion mark facility, also set at 3.00 percent, expires on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
